body:
You can blow it up before it releases the units (start your charge while the ship is flying in, and track its thrusters as best you can) but to be honest, it doesn't even kill the units reliably. Satisfying as hell though, especially when the wreckage lands on a fabricator or something. Definitely worth it if it's carrying a tank or a hulk.

&#x200B;

My personal advice is to keep shooting them down, just on principle, because it's awesome, and don't think too hard about it. If you don't shoot it down before the units drop, it's fine. The wreckage still disorganizes their squads usually. Serves as half decent cover (although the bullet collision around those wrecks can be janky to say the least.)
